      "id": "b3",
      "function": "explanation",
      "scene_type": "rv_board",
      "spoken": "In eighteen sixty-seven comes the atmospheric engine of Otto and Langen. It uses a free piston and lets the gas expand further. According to the lecture, this over-expansion brings about eleven percent. It is a very different machine from a modern engine.",
